o>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ______."
